:25:13Z","value":19,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4182460","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1847286114036927","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo – UPDATE #5","summary":"Hey there!You’ve been rocking the DEMO, sharing feedback and helping us make it better - huge thanks to everyone who’s been part of it!DEMO Update #5 is now live, and yes… We’ve squashed the Black Screen City bug! Alongside that fix, we’ve got a few more improvements ready for you.As always, changes marked with 🎸 were suggested by our awesome community!🎸 Finally fixed the Black Screen City bug🎸 Made French translations of “FOCUS” consistent🎸 “OR” is now translated in band activities and the orga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:38:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036927","verified_at":"2026-10-23T16:47:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1847286114029260","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo – UPDATE #4","summary":"Hey!To all of you who shared your issues whilst playing the Steam Next Fest DEMO or suggested improvements – thank you, it’s an honor to rock with you!Today we’ve released the latest version, which includes a few significant changes:As usually, changes marked with 🎸 have been implemented in response to requests from our community!🎸 Fixed photo remaining on screen after completing an opportunity🎸 Fixed transparency problems with drinks (Karen Date at Cucaracha Bistro)🎸 Added localization for gear","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:31:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029260","verified_at":"2026-10-21T16:06:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1846651706691434","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS featured during Steam Next Fest – third episode of demo NOW AVAILABLE","summary":"Hey Band!The ROCKBEASTS demo is available for free, now expanded to include the third episode, launching alongside the festival. We have also compiled a short changelog so you can see what has been updated over the last few days.There's literally and metaphorically more playing, more dealing with aspiring rock stars, agents and the unforgiving music industry waiting for you 🤘Oh, right! And ROCKBEASTS is now as friendly to gamepad as it is to mouse and keyboard, so that you can rock on in front o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691434","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1846018067933569","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS demo page now available – rock it and review!","summary":"Band…! 🤩There are already so many of you rocking out that we just wanted to say: THANKS! Plain and simple – for playing and letting us know what you think of ROCKBEASTS.We’ve decided to launch a dedicated demo page, which you can find here: Play, rock out, have fun and let us know what you think through review… 🤘 Meanwhile, we’re going back to tuning guitars, changing drumheads and all that sort of thing.Stay tuned, and rock on!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T14:53:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933569","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1846018067930478","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS is coming in January 2027!","summary":"Alright, band!Guitars tuned, mic-check done, throats ripped. Time for some rockin’! 🎸During the Triple-I Showcase, you got to see our latest trailer and hear the news that ROCKBEASTS is coming in January 2027… 🤘 and what a party it’s going to be! You can already play the first two episodes, available as part of the demo on Steam. What’s more! October 19th, will bring you the third episode as part of Steam Next Fest. Matthew Mercer and Sam Riegel of Critical Role have also joined the ROCKBEASTS l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:39:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930478","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1845383656386200","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Next stop for ROCKBEASTS: Triple-I! 🎸","summary":"Hey, crew!We told you the sound check was just the beginning. Now we've got our next gig lined up: ROCKBEASTS is joining Triple-I on October 8th at 6pm CEST / 9am PT.And we're not showing up empty-handed. We've been looking forward to sharing something, but you'll have to wait a little longer to see it for yourselves. No spoilers from the backstage!Grab your spot, tune in, and come make some noise with us!Until then, wishlist ROCKBEASTS on Steam. See you at the show!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T12:40:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386200","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1844751498234950","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Lichthund x Critical Role - Rockbeasts Partnership Announcement","summary":"Big news for the ROCKBEASTS crew!From early on, we believed ROCKBEASTS deserved to rock the biggest stages out there, and we've been working hard to give it that chance. Today, we're happy to share that we've teamed up with Critical Role on both the creative and publishing side, bringing their talent and passion for great characters into the world we've been building with such care.If you know Critical Role, you know they don't do anything halfway. That's exactly the energy we share working on R","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T17:07:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234950","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1832065502823906","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS is heading to Tribeca Festival!","summary":"We're excited to announce that ROCKBEASTS will be featured in the 2026 Tribeca Festival in the Games program!The Tribeca Festival is returning for its milestone 25th edition between June 3rd-14th in New York City. The festival continues its tradition of celebrating visionary storytelling in film, TV, music, podcasts and video games.ROCKBEASTS is one of just 12 games featured in this year's Tribeca Festival! We're honoured that our game was chosen to be featured in such a prestigious event!Find o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-12T13:44:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502823906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1818752592121596","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS featured in the Day of the Devs showcase!","summary":"Did you catch ROCKBEASTS in the Day of the Devs Game Awards showcase today?We're very excited that ROCKBEASTS was one of the featured games in the showcase! Check out the video above where Rafal and Bartek from Lichthund Games sat down to talk about our upcoming rock-and-roll management RPG! 🤘What is ROCKBEASTS?ROCKBEASTS is a rock-and-roll management RPG where you guide a 90s grunge band from garage obscurity to stadium glory. Set up gigs, manage egos, and navigate the music industry in an alte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-10T18:15:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592121596","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1815580768386801","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS wins Excellence in Audio Award at the DevGAMM Awards!","summary":"We're extremely excited to say that ROCKBEASTS has won the Excellence in Audio award at the 2025 DevGAMM Awards in Lisbon!A massive congratulations to everyone in the team for all of the hard work that made this award win possible!And a congratulations to all of the DevGAMM winners and nominees! It's a big honour to be in the company of so many fantastic Indie games!Here's to hopefully many more awards! 🏆","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-10T10:21:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768386801","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1815034433039654","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS Nominated for Two DevGAMM Awards!","summary":"We're thrilled to announce that ROCKBEASTS has been nominated for two DevGAMM Awards, including the Grand Prize Award!ROCKBEASTS is nominated in the following categories:🏆 The Grand Prize🎵 Excellence in AudioWe are incredibly honored to receive these nominations, especially before the game's release! Congratulations to the whole Lichthund team for all their hard work and dedication, all of which made this possible!Fingers crossed for the awards show on November 7th! 🤞About ROCKBEASTS:Lead a band","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-04T17:18:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815034433039654","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1814309641450689","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch the ROCKBEASTS Galaxies Gameplay Trailer!","summary":"What the hell is ROCKBEASTS? Some sort of rhythm game? A visual novel? A management sim for furries? Here's the deal! You manage a band, plan their gigs, pick venues, sell tickets, and then you deal with the ungrateful little shits that are supposed to be your talent!Watch the new ROCKBEASTS trailer:Being a band manager is more than just booking gigs and deciding what is the best tune to get the masses hooked, it’s about dealing with big egos, spoiled brats and a lot of sticky venues!Game Featur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-23T19:51:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641450689","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1808601382438610","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"ROCKBEASTS nominated for Best Audio at the Gamescom Awards!","summary":"ROCKBEASTS has been nominated for the Best Audio category at the Gamescom Awards!Rock 'n' Roll is at the heart of ROCKBEASTS so we couldn't think of a more fitting award nomination! 🤘Voting closes today at 2 PM (CEST) so make sure to get your vote in now! Vote using the link below!VOTE NOW","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-21T09:02:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808601382438610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1805431065369607","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch the new ROCKBEASTS Gameplay Trailer!","summary":"Are you ready to lead a band of misfits and losers to the top of the rock 'n' roll mountain in ROCKBEASTS, the upcoming narrative rock band management game?It's 4am. You've just left a gig at another shitty dive bar in the wrong part of town. Your head pounds. Partly from the booze, partly from the awful din of the headline band, a trio of tortoises torturing their instruments for something they call 'experimental neo-fusion rock'. They called themselves To Shell and Back or something equally sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-18T13:01:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805431065369607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1805065414368794","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Backstage Pass #4 - The Voice Acting of Rockbeasts","summary":"With so many unique and quirky characters in the world of Rockbeasts, we knew early in development that we needed an incredible cast of voice actors to bring them to life! In this Backstage Pass Dev Blog, we'll be pulling back the curtain on our voice acting process!Plus, we've released two more tracks from the Rockbeasts soundtrack! Head over here to give them a listen on the music streaming platform of your choice!The Casting ProcessWe knew early on in development that Rockbeasts was going to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-15T15:30:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805065414368794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1797185861803843","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Backstage Pass #3 - The Music of Rockbeasts","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45513115/b2e29def055b393871b0b795a12a6388acb9145e.gif Rockbeasts! Ready to go wild and let your fur fly? We've just released four songs from the Rockbeasts soundtrack ready for you to listen to and rock-out ahead of the game's release! Listen to them now on your preferred music platform: Rockbeasts EP 1 So, stick on the EP and get ready to this next Backstage Pass Dev Blog! Today we'll be handing over to our composer, Marcin Sonnenberg as he talks about creating Rockbeasts' so","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-22T16:39:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797185861803843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1795917897297482","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Backstage Pass #2 - Developing The Art Of Rockbeasts: Part Two","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45513115/fafb49cd04ed2ec473c5facd1654a3f76cc75ce7.png Rockbeasts! We're back with the second of our Backstage Pass Dev Blogs! Today we're continuing our series looking at the art process behind Rockbeasts! In this blog, we're taking a look at the art design of the environments and world you'll be exploring on your journey to rock stardom! Thank you again for supporting the game and don't forget to wishlist if you haven't already! Interior Design {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45513115/1b3","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-02T16:36:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795917897297482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1793384379343841","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Backstage Pass #1 - Developing The Art Of Rockbeasts","summary":"Rockbeasts! Welcome to the first of our Backstage Pass Dev Blogs! In this series of short posts we want to give you a glimpse behind the scenes as we move towards Rockbeasts' release, sharing our insight into the development process and more detail about the game itself! In this first Backstage Pass blog, we're pulling back the curtain on the art process behind the character designs in Rockbeasts! Our fantastic lead artist, Mateusz took inspiration from a few different sources when designing the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-05T15:59:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1793384379343841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1445880-1792116353359941","game_id":"steam-1445880","kind":"announcement","title":"Listen to the first two Rockbeasts tracks on Spotify! 🎸","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45513115/6753ece9d3a31be7a0ad308c2f2669c7aa92f60a.png What's a band without some killer songs? Crank up the volume and hit up Spotify to check out the first two tracks from the Rockbeasts soundtrack! 🤘 💤 Let Sleeping Dogs Lie 💪 Eight Arms Listen to the first Rockbeasts EP now! https://store.steampowered.com/app/1445880/Rockbeasts/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-02-25T15:25:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/179211635335994